{
  "about": [
    "Market maps for display (plan TR-10, D10; design 1.3, 5.7, 6.1). Python ggwork_pick.observe.market_map is the source;",
    "tests/observe/test_obs_market_map.py pins this file to MARKET_MAPS, and the data page's TS side (TR-24) reads it",
    "instead of copying the alpha-3 lists by hand.",
    "maps: every registered version, each frozen: a change is a new entry, never an edit of an existing one. A set names",
    "its version in FrozenInputs.market_map_version.",
    "groups: display order. countries are GSC alpha-3 codes (ALL is the site total); geos are the Trends geos shown in",
    "the group; core: counted in the Europe-and-North-America figures; note: shown with the group, or null.",
    "A group total is a display sum, never a unit of judgment. A country in no group (the Philippines, India) is shown",
    "only in the site total.",
    "geo_country: the one GSC country each Trends geo links with (WW with ALL); links never pair across a group."
  ],
